# WerewolfTransformCondition$ (CardTraitBase.java:509-513) reads
# MagicStack.lastTurnCast, the spells of the previous turn rotated at each new
# turn (MagicStack.java:965-979). Gatstaf Shepherd is cast on turn 1, so at
# turn 2's upkeep a spell was cast last turn and it stays a Human; nobody casts
# anything on turn 2, so at turn 3's upkeep it transforms.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 1 G
tapformana human 2 G
queue paygeneric G
castspell human 3
resolvestack
# Main1 of turn 1 to the untap step of turn 2, then its upkeep: no trigger.
advance 10
advance
resolvestack
# Upkeep of turn 2 to the upkeep of turn 3: the transform trigger fires.
advance 13
resolvestack
